body:
I am honestly not sure if we want to also use the dfg on the mobile renderer. I would argue that the current approximation is good enough and rather avoid the additional texture read on mobile.
We won't support multiscattering on mobile anyway, and without it the current approximation is close enough that I don't see any reason to upgrade it.

@clayjohn do you have an opinion on that?

